Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(ui): add Design System v3 19 primitives with tests
 and stories
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Implements the 19 primitives of DS §3.1 (Button, IconButton, Link,
TextField, TextArea, Select, Combobox, Checkbox, Radio, Switch,
Segmented, Tabs, Tooltip, Badge, StatusPill, RoleMark, Spinner,
Skeleton, ProgressBar) along with helper primitives (Divider, Kbd,
VisuallyHidden). All primitives forward data-action, data-testid,
and aria-* attributes, with unit tests and Storybook stories.
